  "details": "Contacts are extremely useful, but sometimes you want them to always fire for an avatar to drive background processes (eg; the little Followers people are making, you can have them touch a Contact near the player to stop their walk animation and movement).  It'd be nice if there was an option in the Contact component to ignore the menu toggle and just ALWAYS receive contact from self regardless of the menu setting, rather than hope the player's left the option on in their settings if you make a public avatar.",
